<div class="wrap">
  <h1>Shipping Policy</h1>
  <div class="updated">Last updated: 5 September 2026</div>
  
<div class="card">
<p>Here's what to expect once your order is placed with Jagashilp.</p>
</div>

<h2>Shipping Charges</h2>
<p>We currently offer <strong>free shipping</strong> on all orders across India.</p>

<h2>Dispatch Time</h2>
<p>Since our products are handmade and many are made-to-order, please allow <strong>2–4 business days</strong> for your order to be carefully made and packed before it is dispatched.</p>

<h2>Delivery Time</h2>
<p>Once dispatched, orders are typically delivered within <strong>5–9 business days</strong>, depending on your location, through our courier partners. You'll be able to track your order's status from the "My Orders" section of your account.</p>

<h2>Payment Options for Delivery</h2>
<p>We offer both prepaid (Razorpay — cards, UPI, net banking, wallets) and Cash on Delivery (COD) options at checkout.</p>

<h2>Delays</h2>
<p>During sale periods, festivals, or due to circumstances like weather or courier disruptions, delivery may occasionally take longer than the usual timeline. We'll keep you updated in case of any significant delay.</p>

<h2>Shipping Area</h2>
<p>We currently ship only within India.</p>

<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>For any shipping-related query, reach out to us at <a href="mailto:v8xmedia@gmail.com">v8xmedia@gmail.com</a> or call +91 70614 59730.</p>

</div>
<footer>Made with care by Jagashilp — hand-doodled in India</footer>
